WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.857
It's almost Mother's Day.

2
00:00:09.858 --> 00:00:15.911
I want to do something special for Mom.

3
00:00:15.912 --> 00:00:22.500
Hmm. What can I do?

4
00:00:22.501 --> 00:00:27.952
She's a great mom.

5
00:00:27.953 --> 00:00:33.809
I must think of something amazing.

6
00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:42.459
I know! I'll make a card!

7
00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:45.435
Dear Mom,

8
00:00:45.436 --> 00:00:49.186
I promise to clean my room.

9
00:00:49.187 --> 00:00:52.813
I promise to put away my dirty socks.

10
00:00:52.814 --> 00:00:57.492
I promise to help you wash dishes.

11
00:00:57.493 --> 00:01:01.014
I promise to be nice to my brother.

12
00:01:01.015 --> 00:01:07.244
(I'll even share my games with him!)

13
00:01:07.245 --> 00:01:12.906
I promise to clean up after the dog.

14
00:01:12.907 --> 00:01:18.858
When you say "Wake up," I will listen.

15
00:01:18.859 --> 00:01:24.513
When you say "Time for bed," I won't complain.

16
00:01:24.514 --> 00:01:31.738
When you make broccoli for dinner, I will eat it.

17
00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:36.662
When you're happy, I will dance with you.

18
00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:41.961
When you're sad, I will give you hugs.

19
00:01:41.962 --> 00:01:48.424
I promise all these things.

20
00:01:48.425 --> 00:01:49.014
Love,

21
00:01:49.015 --> 00:01:54.926
Abby

22
00:01:54.927 --> 00:01:58.826
On Mother's Day I run to Mom.

23
00:01:58.827 --> 00:02:02.230
"Here, Mom!" I say.

24
00:02:02.231 --> 00:02:09.972
"Happy Mother's Day!"

